<title>GERMANY: Feb adjusted German jobless rate 11.3 pct - Buba.</title>
<headline>Feb adjusted German jobless rate 11.3 pct - Buba.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bundesbank reported the following seasonally adjusted unemployment rates (pct).</p>
<p>PAN-GERMAN UNEMPLOYMENT	Feb 97    Jan 97	Feb 96</p>
<p> Rate				 11.3	 11.3	10.3</p>
<p>WEST GERMAN UNEMPLOYMENT</p>
<p> Rate				  9.8	  9.8	 8.9</p>
<p>EAST GERMAN UNEMPLOYMENT</p>
<p> Rate				 17.4	 17.3	16.1</p>
<p>NOTE - The Federal Labour Office earlier reported the bulk of the jobless figures. Previously announced data in brackets.</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, 49-228-26097150</p>
</text>
